
### 1. Get all events
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events

### 2. Get upcoming events
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/upcoming

### 3. Get one event
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/evt-101

### 4. Get sessions for an event
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/evt-101/sessions

### 5. Get one session
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/evt-101/sessions/ses-201

### 6. Filter by category
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?category=technology

### 7. Filter by location
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?location=Main%20Campus

### 8. Filter by publication status
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?isPublished=true

### 9. Sort and paginate
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?sortBy=eventDate&order=asc&page=2&limit=2

### 10. Create a new event
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Campus Sports Day",
  "description": "A day of sports and student activities.",
  "location": "Sports Field",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-30T09:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "sports",
  "isPublished": true
}

### 11. Test validation with missing fields
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Incomplete Event"
}

### 12. Test event not found
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/evt-999
